## Terminology
Reports: Issuer Ownership Report (IOR), Public Ownership Report (POR), Temporary Shareholder List (TSL), Extract of Owners (EoO), Major Owners (MO).
Variants: Full owner list, Issuer's shareholder list, Regulatory, General Meeting, Public, Full.
EoO has no variants (blank in spec). MO uses the variant "Full".

## A. SHOW DATA CHECKBOXES
Format: Functionality | Default | Availability (Report: variants) | Behaviour

1. Address information subject to non-disclosure | Unchecked (No)
   IOR: Full owner list, Issuer's shareholder list | TSL: Full owner list, Regulatory | EoO | MO: Full
   Behaviour: in EoO the WHOLE owner row disappears for owners under "non-disclosure". In all other reports only the address (and the icon in the GUI) disappears for those owners. "Non-disclosure" means non-disclosure to all owners.
2. Identification code | Checked (Yes)
   IOR: Full owner list, Issuer's shareholder list | TSL: Full owner list, Regulatory | EoO | MO: Full
3. Sector information | Checked (Yes)
   IOR: Full owner list | TSL: Full owner list | EoO | MO: Full
4. Depository participant | Checked (Yes)
   IOR: Full owner list | TSL: Full owner list | EoO | MO: Full
5. Total shares | Unchecked (No)
   IOR: Issuer's shareholder list, General Meeting | POR: Public | TSL: Regulatory, General Meeting
   Behaviour: hides both Grand Total and Sub totals inside the cell, with all numbers related to it, in the application and in the PDF.
6. % of book-entries | Unchecked (No)
   Same availability as Total shares. Behaviour: hides the whole column.
7. Total number of votes | Unchecked (No)
   IOR: Issuer's shareholder list, General Meeting | TSL: Regulatory, General Meeting. Behaviour: hides the whole column.
8. % of total number of votes | Unchecked (No)
   Same availability as Total number of votes. Behaviour: hides the whole column.

## B. FILTERS
9. Directly-registered holdings | Default: Included
   IOR: Full owner list | POR: Full | TSL: Full | EoO | MO: Full
10. Nominee-registered holdings | Default: Included
    IOR: Full owner list | POR: Full | TSL: Full | EoO | MO: Full
11. Sector | Default: All Sectors (L2)
    IOR: Full owner list | TSL: Full | EoO | MO: Full
    Behaviour: the sector filter works on Level 2.

## C. SORT
12. Three sort options in the Issuer Ownership Report and its "relatives": By Owner, By Number of Shares, By Number of Votes. Default: By Owner, Ascending.
    Applies to all reports and variants. Sort works only where the sortable column is available in that report and variant (e.g. no "By Number of Votes" if the votes column is hidden or absent).

